; Our Rtlib32.dll: every export forwards to the original engine, renamed Rtlib32_orig.dll.
; Rewritten functions are switched in by patching the original (see hooks.c), so the
; engine's internal calls reach them too. Same names and ordinals as the original.
LIBRARY Rtlib32.dll
